Note shafts currently after title overlay; keep.

Add methods drawForegroundFlora and drawWeather before drawForeground or after.

Flora implementation:

```
drawForegroundFlora() {
 const ctx = this.ctx;
 const theme=this.theme;
 const T=this.t;
 const layers = [
  {spacing:220,p:1.08,scale:.75,alpha:.5, color:rgba(theme.near,.75)},
  {spacing:300,p:1.22,scale:1,alpha:.72, color:rgba('#04100c',.85)}
 ];
 layers.forEach((L,li)=>{
  this.layer(L.spacing,L.p,(x,i)=>{
    const pick=hash(i*13.3+li*5.1);
    const h=(30+hash(i*7.7+li)*54)*L.scale;
    const baseY=this.vh+6;
    ctx.save();
    ctx.globalAlpha = L.alpha;
    if (pick<0.45) draw grass tuft
    else if (pick<0.72) fern
    else if (pick<0.88) mushroom
    else rock
    ctx.restore();
  })
 })
 // near glows
 for i<5 ...
}
```
`this.layer` positions x relative to camera; y fixed bottom.

Grass tuft:
```
ctx.strokeStyle=color; lineWidth=2.2;
for b in 0..6:
  const bx=x+(hash...-.5)*26;
  const bh=h*(0.5+...);
